Some of the annotations of Matrilin complex disappeared compared to when placing this ticket [#31067](https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/31067)

Need to add the following gene products to the annotation of Matrilin complex (GO:0120216):

- [x] MATN1: Hs: [P21941](https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/P21941/entry); Mm: [P51942](https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/P51942/entry);
- [x] MATN2: Hs: [O00339](https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/O00339/entry); Mm: already have annotation of Matn2;
- [x] MATN3: Hs: [O15232](https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/O15232/entry); Mm: [O35701](https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/O35701/entry);
- [x] MATN4: Hs: [O95460](https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/O95460/entry); Mm: already have annotation of Matn4.
